msgid "T \\_\\_builtin_elementwise_maxnum(T x, T y)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../LanguageExtensions.md:60
msgid ""
"return x or y, whichever is larger. Follows IEEE 754-2008 semantics (maxNum) "
"with +0.0>-0.0. See [LangRef](http://llvm.org/docs/LangRef.html#i-fminmax-"
