"return x or y, whichever is smaller. Follows IEEE 754-2008 semantics "
"(minNum) with +0.0>-0.0. See [LangRef](http://llvm.org/docs/LangRef.html#i-"
"fminmax-family) for the comparison."
msgstr ""

