msgid "T \\_\\_builtin_elementwise_maximum(T x, T y)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../LanguageExtensions.md:60
msgid ""
"return x or y, whichever is larger. Follows IEEE 754-2019 semantics, see "
"[LangRef](http://llvm.org/docs/LangRef.html#i-fminmax-family) for the "
"comparison."
