"(<https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/ms177194(v=VS.100).aspx>), as "
"well as nearly all of the [Embarcadero C++ type traits](<http://docwiki."
"embarcadero.com/RADStudio/Rio/en/Type_Trait_Functions_(C%2B%2B11)_Index>)."
